tpm 1
boot power
# boot-select: power-on with blank cards. SW_ON's copyright; Start skips the story (TIT_DEMO);
# Start on the title ("press start"); on the mode select Right (Puzzle), Cross (zoom in), Cross
# (confirm): Puzzle Mode starts.
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
100 1 START
program TITLE
100 1 START
program SELECT
290 4 RIGHT
390 4 CROSS
590 4 CROSS
program PAZLE
end 120
